      "title": "Build time",
      "items": [
        "beforeBuild reads the history with git log, cat-file and ls-tree",
        "Added files, unchanged renames and whitespace-only edits are left out of the lists",
        "While Markdown compiles, rendered blocks get their source lines and page route"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Browser",
      "items": [
        "The diff and marking modules load only when the URL has ?diff=",
        "Marks go on the version the page shows; removed lines appear in place as source",
        "The recent changes page lists the page diffs of each commit"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "What gets published",
      "items": [
        "_git-diff/ becomes static files that anyone can fetch",
        "Only the processed subject line of a commit message is written",
        "Versions older than the since option are not written"
      ]
